OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Fheavy and thundery showers are
OL,7,Fexpected through the evening, though
OL,8,Fslowly fading away overnight with
OL,9,Fclear spells developing. Staying mild,
OL,10,Fwith a few mist patches forming by
OL,11,Fdawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FShowers return for the
OL,14,Fmorning, but these should ease for
OL,15,Fmany through the afternoon as a ridge
OL,16,Fof high pressure moves in. Feeling
OL,17,Ffresher, with a northwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
