OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FStaying on the mixed side, with
OL,7,Ffurther showers and longer spells of
OL,8,Frain through this period. Some sunnier
OL,9,Fmoments in between. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average for early
OL,11,Fmeteorological autumn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
